1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,500
A supersonic aircraft produces overlapping sound waves that form a shock front and a sonic boom.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Similarly, a muon moving through water can produce electromagnetic waves that reinforce one another in particular directions.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:28,500
The resulting radiation has a conical structure around the direction of motion.

4
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,000
This is called Cherenkov radiation.
